<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_859_2397.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnser früntlich willig diennst sampt allem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mügen</unclear> eren
<lb n="2"/>liebs unnd guets zuovor, fromen fürsichtigenn ersamen
<lb n="3"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyßenn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jnsunnders</unclear> liebenn unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guetten</unclear> fründ.
<lb n="4"/>Uff den anzug so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eüwer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ver</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ornette</unclear> jn namen deß
<lb n="5"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-552" cert="medium" resp="#ner">spitals</orgName>, an etlich unser <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lanndt</unclear> lüt, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vergangner</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werch</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lannge</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zehenden</unclear> so die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserenn</unclear>
<lb n="7"/>zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuon</unclear> schuldig sin solttenn, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getthon</unclear>, unnd
<lb n="8"/>aber die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnserenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">maint</unclear> wil <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sÿ</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">um</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">söllichen</unclear> an
<lb n="9"/>zug <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mee</unclear> dan <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mans</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bedencken</unclear>, von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">niemandts</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">erfordret</unclear>, noch anzogen worden, der wegen zuo thon
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nüt</unclear> schuldig sin, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">u</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">habennd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nun</unclear> etlich eren lüt
<lb n="12"/>bester mainug, von unserem ratz <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geornnet</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sölligenn</unclear>
<lb n="13"/>span, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">enzwüschen</unclear> eüch und den unseren, deß glichen
<lb n="14"/>gegen herenn von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Sannt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Gallen</unclear></placeName> so ouch glichen an zug
<lb n="15"/>wie jr, an die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethon</unclear>, jn der güetikait
<lb n="16"/>früntlich zuo ver tragn. Daruff wir die <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> als
<lb n="17"/>ver ornette, ver standen, wie das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sÿ</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nüt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andrist</unclear>
<lb n="18"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">maint</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sÿ</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hettenn</unclear> die eüweren, deß glichen
<lb n="19"/>des heren von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Sant</unclear> Gallenn</placeName> an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wält</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßnno</unclear> spans
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">halbenn</unclear> gegen den unseren, mit nüßwen lasster
<lb n="21"/>täding. (doch vor behallte jedem teil jn 14 tagen
<lb n="22"/>zuo old ab zuo sagenn) ver <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">tragn</unclear>, so sye jnen deß sider
<lb n="23"/>kain anttwurt, ja <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">older</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nain</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nie</unclear> zuo komen,
<lb n="24"/>darum farr speen zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guote</unclear>. So gelangt unser
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früntliche</unclear> pitt an eüch, jr wellend <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gschriftlich</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_859_2398.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thuen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brichten</unclear>, ob ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">selbigen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">span</unclear>, also wie sy in mit
<lb n="27"/>ain <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andren</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ver</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thiegt</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wellend</unclear> lassen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gschlicht</unclear> und
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gricht</unclear> sin oder <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nüt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">do</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mit</unclear> sich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ieder</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wüß</unclear> der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gebür</unclear>
<lb n="29"/>nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> halten. Den wir sunst <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ieder</unclear> zit nach pür=
<lb n="30"/>lichenn und früntlichenn willenn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bewisen</unclear> gnaigt
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sind</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">üch</unclear> hie mit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">göttlicher</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnaden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bfolgende</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Datto</unclear>
<lb n="32"/><origDate when="1563" cert="medium" resp="#ner">den 8 tag december anno <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">im</unclear> 63 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jor</unclear></origDate>.
<lb n="33"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-506" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Lanndt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aman</unclear> und
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rath</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> Appennzell</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_859_2399.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_859_2400.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="35"/>Den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fromen</unclear> fürsichtigen ersamen und
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wysen</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">burgermeister</unclear> und rath der statt
<lb n="37"/>Sant Gallen</orgName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unseren</unclear> lieben und guoten fründen
</p>
